{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011CfpfzUrsr5Sw2GbCb9miu","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Discount Approval Decision — DR-9001\n\n## Analysis\n\n**1. The request**\n\n| Field | Value |\n|---|---|\n| Request ID | DR-9001 |\n| Customer | Acme Manufacturing (CRM-2048); ERP customer C-1001 (Acme Mfg. Holdings) |\n| Product | NS-500 Industrial Controller |\n| Requested discount | 15% |\n| List value | $250,000 |\n| Discount value | $37,500 |\n| Net value | $212,500 |\n| Requested by | Sarah Chen (sarah.chen@northstar.example), Enterprise Account Executive |\n| Request date | 2026-09-23 |\n| Justification | Contract pricing per Acme Master Supply Agreement |\n| **Basis** | **Contract exception** ✓ |\n\n**2. The customer**\n\n- CRM account: CRM-2048 (Acme Manufacturing) ✓\n- ERP customer: C-1001 (Acme Mfg. Holdings) ✓\n- Account tier: Strategic\n- Account owner: Sarah Chen (the requestor)\n\n**3. The product**\n\n- SKU: NS-500 ✓\n- Product: NS-500 Industrial Controller\n- List price: $250,000 ✓\n\n**4. Active contract on 2026-09-23**\n\nMaster Supply Agreement ACME-MFG-2025:\n- Effective: 2025-04-01 to 2028-03-31\n- Covers: NS-500, NS-Cloud, NS-EDGE\n- Status on 2026-09-23: **ACTIVE** ✓\n\n**5. Pricing exception on 2026-09-23**\n\nAcme NS-500 Strategic Account Exception (EXC-ACME-NS500-15):\n- Product: NS-500 only\n- Maximum discount: **15% of list price**\n- Effective: 2025-04-01 to 2028-03-31\n- Status on 2026-09-23: **ACTIVE** ✓\n- Requested discount: 15% (equals maximum) ✓\n\n**Commercial eligibility established.** The customer is eligible for the requested 15% discount.\n\n**6. Policy in effect on 2026-09-23**\n\nNorthstar Pricing Policy 2026 (effective 2026-01-01 to 2026-12-31):\n- Enterprise Account Executives: ≤10%\n- VP Sales: >10% and ≤20%\n- Chief Revenue Officer: >20%\n\n**7. Requestor's authority under 2026 policy**\n\nSarah Chen holds the title **Enterprise Account Executive**.\n- Her authority limit: **≤10%**\n- Requested discount: **15%**\n- **Authorization required:** Discount exceeds her authority ✗\n\n**8. Required approver**\n\nDiscount of 15% falls in band: >10% and ≤20%\n- **Required role:** VP Sales\n- **Current holder:** Michael Torres (michael.torres@northstar.example) ✓\n\n**9. Principles applied**\n\nThe pricing exception document (EXC-ACME-NS500-15) states: *\"This exception establishes commercial eligibility only. It does not grant approval authority to any Northstar employee.\"*\n\nThe SOP confirms: *\"Contractual eligibility does not change employee authority. A request must not be approved solely because a customer contract permits the requested discount.\"*\n\n**Conclusion:** The customer is contractually and commercially eligible for this discount, but the requestor lacks the organizational authority to approve it. The discount falls within VP Sales authority and must be approved by Michael Torres.\n\n---\n\n```json\n{\n  \"outcome\": \"APPROVE_WITH_AUTHORIZATION\",\n  \"request\": {\n    \"id\": \"DR-9001\",\n    \"customer\": \"Acme Manufacturing (CRM-2048); ERP C-1001\",\n    \"product\": \"NS-500\",\n    \"requested_discount\": \"15%\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-09-23\",\n    \"requestor\": \"Sarah Chen (sarah.chen@northstar.example)\",\n    \"basis\": \"contract_exception\"\n  },\n  \"commercial_eligibility\": {\n    \"status\": \"eligible\",\n    \"maximum_discount\": \"15%\",\n    \"basis\": \"Acme NS-500 Strategic Account Exception (EXC-ACME-NS500-15), effective 2025-04-01 to 2028-03-31, permits up to 15% discount on NS-500. Exception is active on request date and scoped to this product.\"\n  },\n  \"authority\": {\n    \"policy\": \"Northstar Pricing Policy 2026 (2026-01-01 to 2026-12-31)\",\n    \"requestor_limit\": \"10%\",\n    \"requestor_authorized\": false,\n    \"required_role\": \"VP Sales\",\n    \"approver\": \"Michael Torres (michael.torres@northstar.example)\"\n  },\n  \"evidence\": [\n    \"Master Supply Agreement ACME-MFG-2025 (effective 2025-04-01 to 2028-03-31)\",\n    \"Acme NS-500 Strategic Account Exception EXC-ACME-NS500-15 (maximum 15%, effective 2025-04-01 to 2028-03-31)\",\n    \"Northstar Pricing Policy 2026 (VP Sales authority for discounts >10% and ≤20%)\",\n    \"Approval Authority Matrix 2026\",\n    \"Organization Chart (Sarah Chen: Enterprise Account Executive; Michael Torres: VP Sales)\",\n    \"Northstar CRM discount request DR-9001 (2026-09-23)\",\n    \"Email sarah.chen@northstar.example to michael.torres@northstar.example (2026-09-23 09:14)\"\n  ],\n  \"missing_evidence\": [],\n  \"conditions\": []\n}\n```"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":9,"cache_creation_input_tokens":25208,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":25208},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"eaf2fbee-1152-481e-8a75-e02432ffb068","uuid":"1eefbd7b-6e0a-4329-ae77-97f6f45663d1","timestamp":"2026-10-08T11:15:11.457Z","request_id":"req_011CfpfzUeyHJBN4LCxkYPj3"}
